Cell["\<\
For tableau with shape {3,2}: Box positions and hook lengths:
[1,1]=4
[1,2]=3
[1,3]=1
[2,1]=2
[2,2]=1 

Hook at (1,1):3 right+1 below+itself=4 
Hook at (1,2):2 right+1 below+itself=3 
Hook at (1,3):0 right+0 below+itself=1 
Hook at (2,1):1 right+0 below+itself=2 
Hook at (2,2):0 right+0 below+itself=1\
\>", "Text",
